が実力者のテスターを見つけたと聞いたが…","nextNodeIds":[756620102]},{"nodeId":756620102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":929515754,"text":"お前だったのか。よかった。","nextNodeIds":[756620103]},{"nodeId":756620103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14221,"speakerName":"アハウ","textMapHash":3914985938,"text":"チッ、なんでお前まで来やがったんだ？ったく、キィニチと一緒で、依頼となったら見境がねぇんだな。","nextNodeIds":[756620104]},{"nodeId":756620104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":1948442866,"text":"おっと、新しい依頼の知らせだ——「口うるさい竜を黙らせてほしい」だとさ。","nextNodeIds":[756620105,756620107]},{"nodeId":756620105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2198929066,"text":"#いま{M#俺}{F#私}が出した。","nextNodeIds":[756620106]},{"nodeId":756620106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14221,"speakerName":"アハウ","textMapHash":4214022410,"text":"ぶ…無礼な！…フン、よくも偉大なる聖龍をバカにしてくれたな！ぜってぇ代償を払ってもらうぜ！","nextNodeIds":[756620109]},{"nodeId":756620109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":1320397642,"text":"#さて、本題に戻ろう。今回は{NICKNAME}にいくつかのステージをテストしてもらいたい。難易度やバランスはお前の期待を裏切らないと思う。","nextNodeIds":[756620110]},{"nodeId":756620110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14221,"speakerName":"アハウ","textMapHash":1969570730,"text":"ハッ、オレに言わせりゃ、難易度ゼロだな。","nextNodeIds":[756620111]},{"nodeId":756620111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":2094735634,"text":"「くじで引いたバカな仲間とチームを組んで、目隠しした状態で崖から飛び降りる。」——こういうのならお前も手ごたえを感じるか？","nextNodeIds":[756620112]},{"nodeId":756620112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":421470418,"text":"くじの中にユムカ竜は一割。残りは溶岩の像と岩スライムだ。","nextNodeIds":[756620113,756620116]},{"nodeId":756620113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4239182338,"text":"下手したら死ぬね。","nextNodeIds":[756620114]},{"nodeId":756620114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14221,"speakerName":"アハウ","textMapHash":580096418,"text":"フン、オレの従者とこれだけ付き合ってきて、まだ「懸木の民」の趣味が分かってないのか？これはオレからお前への優しいアドバイスだぞ。","nextNodeIds":[756620115]},{"nodeId":756620115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":2223067842,"text":"なら、手本を見せてもらおうか？","nextNodeIds":[756620120]},{"nodeId":756620120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14221,"speakerName":"アハウ","textMapHash":2978177242,"text":"…こんなへっぽこ挑戦に参加させるなんて、偉大なる聖龍への冒涜だ！","nextNodeIds":[756620121]},{"nodeId":756620121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":3242112770,"text":"とにかく、イラードは俺に十分な報酬を提示してくれた。お前も、楽しみながら報酬を手に入れられることを願ってる。","nextNodeIds":[756620122,756620123]},{"nodeId":756620122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3129446218,"text":"うん、楽しみ！","nextNodeIds":[756620124]},{"nodeId":756620124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":3015034402,"text":"うまくいくといいな。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":756620123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2393358338,"text":"任せて！","nextNodeIds":[756620124]},{"nodeId":756620116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2334468610,"text":"面白いかも…","nextNodeIds":[756620117]},{"nodeId":756620117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14221,"speakerName":"アハウ","textMapHash":3412678570,"text":"ほらほら、聞いたか？見る目も知識も考え方も、こいつのほうがお前よりすべてが上だな！","nextNodeIds":[756620118]},{"nodeId":756620118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4261142778,"text":"まずはアハウ、お手本を見せて。","nextNodeIds":[756620119]},{"nodeId":756620119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":3024862562,"text":"賛成だ。アハウは体が小さくて動きが早いから、魔物に殴られても、地面に投げつけられて穴ができてしまう、なんてことはないだろう。","nextNodeIds":[756620120]},{"nodeId":756620107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3772710594,"text":"後回しでよさそうだね。","nextNodeIds":[756620108]},{"nodeId":756620108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14221,"speakerName":"アハウ","textMapHash":2813290642,"text":"フン…偉大なる聖龍の味方をしたからって、礼なんか期待するなよ！","nextNodeIds":[756620109]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7566201,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7566201],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","count":10},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14221,"speakerName":"アハウ","count":7},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":7}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","BEGCMMJKCFC":[],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":4116994974,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_GUIDE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":true,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Natlan_75662/Q7566201","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","AOLKCANJCMJ":5,"BKDENCDKDEE":"","BPIIFMJLJAJ":[],"DAMGEPEMGNO":false,"DBACCKDPONG":[],"DIAFFIANKPH":false,"DKOMBMCJMMN":false,"EFBOKHEHKJM":[],"EIDINNIHMHD":false,"EKANPNMEFMG":[],"ENDBMMDPPAH":[],"FALLCBHGKON":"LOGIC_NONE","GEPGLHFDBNF":[],"GLJMLHNKKKO":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","HJFLPAICAEO":false,"HNFEAICLPLM":[],"HPPIPDNHFJG":false,"IBGGIIDBOAG":false,"IEFDIICFIJK":756620101,"ILHDCGDKKKA":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","ILHDNJDDEOP":7566201,"JGFEJPBPHGJ"